  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "Blackthorn gives Nicco a pair of leather boots.",
      "outcome": "success",
      "exception": null,
      "narration": "Blackthorn reaches into a fold of her aubergine suit and produces a worn pair of leather boots, then pauses, her nearly black eyes sliding over Nicco's visible white hairs without comment. \"On the house,\" she says, but does not extend them further. \"Consider it an opening favor—if you're staying.\"\n\nShe turns slightly, glancing toward the Tower's heavy wooden entrance, then back to Nicco. \"I'm Blackthorn. I handle arrangements for certain parties who need things moved, housed, or otherwise managed.\" Her voice carries no particular warmth, just the brisk patience of someone who dislikes wasted time. \"If you're settling in and need supplies, labor, or information about who's who in the neighborhood, I trade in all three. Fair rates. No complications unless you bring them.\"",
